{
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.JojoGuard": "Jojo stands at the very edge of your camp, as still as a statue. He's so motionless that you're almost worried for a moment, but his head nods in recognition after a moment."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.JojoBedroll": "There is a small bedroll for Jojo near your {0}, though the mouse is probably hanging around the camp's perimeter."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.RathazulWork": "Tucked into a shaded corner of the rocks is a bevy of alchemical devices and equipment. "
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.RathazulSleeping": "The alchemist is absent from his usual work location. He must be sleeping right now."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.RathazulChemicals": "The alchemist Rathazul looks to be hard at work with his chemicals, working on who knows what."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.RathazulFinished": " Some kind of spider-silk-based equipment is hanging from a nearby rack. <b>He's finished with the task you gave him!</b>"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.RathazulSilkWork": "Tucked into a shaded corner of the rocks is a bevy of alchemical devices and equipment. The alchemist Rathazul looks to be hard at work on the silken equipment you've commissioned him to craft."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieSleepWith": "Your harpy matron seems fairly impatient to get to bed with you, the look in her eyes betraying pure lust."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieSleepOne": "Sophie lays in her nest, your daughter laying blissfully on her bosom."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieSleepMany": "Sophie lays in her nest, surrounded by your daughters."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieSleepAlone": "Sophie lays in her nest, tits drooping to her sides as she splays herself."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieGloss": "Sophie is sitting by herself, applying yet another layer of glittering lip gloss to her full lips."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieBrush": "Sophie is sitting in her nest, idly brushing out her feathers. Occasionally, she looks up from her work to give you a sultry wink and a come-hither gaze."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieFuss": "Sophie is fussing around in her nest, straightening bits of straw and grass, trying to make it more comfortable. After a few minutes, she flops down in the middle and reclines, apparently satisfied for the moment."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieReadBimbo": "Your platinum-blonde harpy, Sophie, is currently reading a book--a marked change from her bimbo-era behavior. Occasionally, though, she glances up from the page and gives you a lusty look. Some things never change..."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieRead": "Your pink harpy, Sophie, is currently reading a book. She seems utterly absorbed in it, though you question how she obtained it. Occasionally, though, she'll glance up from the pages to shoot you a lusty look."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieAcrossDaughters": "across from your daughters"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieSurroundedDaughters": "surrounded by your daughters"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.Her": "her"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.Them": "them"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.SophieTeaching": "Sophie is sitting in her nest, {0}, apparently trying to teach {1} about hunting and gathering techniques. Considering their unusual upbringing, it can't be as easy for them..."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.NextToCabin": "next to your cabin"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.NearBedroll": "near the base of your own"
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaWait": "Izma waits expectantly outside your cabin."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaSleep": "Near your bedroll lays Izma, settled quietly facing her chest as she sleeps."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaBedroll": "Neatly laid {0} is a worn bedroll belonging to Izma, your tigershark lover. It's a snug fit for her toned body, though it has some noticeable cuts and tears in the fabric. Close to her bed is her old trunk, almost as if she wants to have it at arms length if anyone tries to rob her in her sleep."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaReading": "Izma's lazily sitting on the trunk beside her bedroll, reading one of the many books from inside it. She smiles happily when your eyes linger on her, and you know full well she's only half-interested in it."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaStream": "You notice Izma isn't around right now. She's probably gone off to the nearby stream to get some water. Never mind, she comes around from behind a rock, still dripping wet."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IzmaWet": "Izma is lying on her back near her bedroll. You wonder at first just why she isn't using her bed, but as you look closer you notice all the water pooled beneath her and the few droplets running down her arm, evidence that she's just returned from the stream."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaGuard": "Kiha solemnly guards the edge of your encampment, her fiery eyes glued to the horizon as she grips her axe firmly."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaSleep": "With battle-axe in arm's reach, Kiha is managing to get some shut-eye."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaPolish": "Kiha is sitting near the fire, her axe laying across her knees as she polishes it."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaBreastfeed": "Kiha is breastfeeding her offspring right now."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaStories": "Kiha is telling stories to her draconic children right now."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaPatrol": "Kiha's out right now, likely patrolling for demons to exterminate. You're sure a loud call could get her attention."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.KihaDummies": "Kiha is utterly decimating a set of practice dummies she's set up out on the edge of camp. All of them have crudely drawn horns. Most of them are on fire."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleWait": "You see Marble preparing to go to sleep with you, stifling a yawn as she gets ready."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleSleep": "Marble is asleep."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleBedroll": "A second bedroll rests next to yours; a large two handed hammer sometimes rests against it, depending on whether or not its owner needs it at the time. "
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleFamily": "Marble isn't here right now; she's still off to see her family."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleNursery": "Marble herself is currently in the nursery, putting your children to bed."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleTraining": "Marble is off in an open area to the side of your camp right now. She is practicing with her large hammer, going through her daily training. You're sure she'd be back in moments if you needed her."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleBedWait": "Marble is hanging around her bedroll waiting for you to come to bed. However, sometimes she lies down for a bit, and sometimes she paces next to it."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MarbleAround": "Marble herself is in camp, keeping an eye on things."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.PhyllaChildrenOne": "You see Phylla's anthill in the distance. Every now and then you see one of your children exit the anthill to unload some dirt before continuing back down into the colony. It makes you feel good knowing your offspring are so productive."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.PhyllaChildrenFew": "You see Phylla's anthill in the distance. Every now and then you see a few of your many children exit the anthill to unload some dirt before vanishing back inside. It makes you feel good knowing your offspring are so productive."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.PhyllaChildrenMany": "You see Phylla's anthill in the distance. Every now and then you see some of your children exit the anthill using main or one of the additional entrances to unload some dirt. Some of them instead of unloading dirt come out to fulfill some other task that their mother gave them. You feel a little nostalgic seeing how this former small colony has grown to such a magnificent size."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.PhyllaAlone": "You see Phylla's anthill in the distance. Phylla appears out of the anthill to unload some dirt. She looks over to your campsite and gives you an excited wave before heading back into the colony. It makes you feel good to know she's so close."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.LatexSleep": "The black latex slime lays motionless in a secluded section of rocks, sleeping."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.LatexLurk": "Slime lurks in a secluded section of rocks, only venturing out when called for or when she needs to gather water from the stream."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MilkSleep": "Your milk-girl has fallen asleep, using her cleavage as a pillow."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.MilkAwake": "Your well-endowed, dark-skinned milk-girl is here. She flicks hopeful eyes towards you whenever she thinks she has your attention."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.Ceraph": "While she is, of course, nowhere to be seen, you could summon Ceraph."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.ArianWait": "The pale lizan waves to you from nearby, giving you a questioning glance and nodding towards your cabin."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.ArianSleep": "Arian's tent is closed up at its usual location, with its mystical lizan occupant resting inside."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.ArianTent": "Arian's tent is here, if you'd like to go inside."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaAwait": "You see the salamander Helia pacing around camp, anxiously awaiting your departure to the harpy roost. Seeing you looking her way, she perks up, obviously ready to get underway."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaWait": "Your salamander lover is leaning against a rock, clearly about to nod off. It seems she doesn't want to wait much longer to join you in your bed."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaSleep": "The salamander berserker is drooling in her sleep, empty bottle of alcohol still in hand."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaVodka": "Hel is currently sitting at the edge of camp, surrounded by her scraps of armor, sword, and a few half-empty bottles of vodka. By the way she's grunting and growling, it looks like she's getting ready to flip her shit and go running off into the plains in her berserker state."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaPlains": "Hel's out of camp at the moment, adventuring on the plains. You're sure she'd be on hand in moments if you needed her, though."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaFamily": "Hel's out visiting her family in Tel'Adre right now, though you're sure she's only moments away if you need her."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HeliaHammock": "Hel is fussing around her hammock, checking her gear and sharpening her collection of blades. Each time you glance her way, though, the salamander puts a little extra sway in her hips and her tail wags happily."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HelspawnWait": "{0} is spending her time outside your cabin as she waits for you to come to bed, sleepily flashing you a loving smile when she catches sight of you."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HelspawnSleep": "{0} is sleeping a moderate distance from her mother, looking far more well-kept than Helia."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HelspawnCamp": "Your daughter {0} has set up her own bedroll a moderate distance away from her mother's. She herself is currently busy nosing about camp."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IsabellaSleep": "Isabella is asleep in her part of camp."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IsabellaBreakfast": "Isabella is busy eating some kind of grain-based snack for breakfast. The curly-haired cow-girl gives you a smile when she sees you look her way."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IsabellaSewing": "Isabella, the red-headed cow-girl, is busy with a needle and thread, fixing up some of her clothes."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IsabellaCleaning": "Isabella is busy cleaning up the camp, but when she notices you looking her way, she stretches up and arches her back, pressing eight bullet-hard nipples into the sheer silk top she prefers to wear."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.IsabellaAround": "Isabella is busy around camp."
"Scenes.Camp.Desc.HolliTree": "Holli is in her tree at the edges of your camp. You could go visit her if you want."  "Scenes.Camp.AcceptChallenge.BlinkOfAnEye": "[pg]In the blink of an eye, you vanish."
  "Scenes.Camp.AcceptChallenge.LightBendsTwists": "[pg]Light around you bends and twists, the sound warping and morphing as you are dematerialized."
  "Scenes.Camp.AcceptChallenge.StepThroughPortal": "You step through the portal, and feel as if you're moving through space at unbelievable speeds."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.ExaminePortal": "ExaminePortal"
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.ExaminePortalHint": "Examine the portal."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.PortalFirst": "You walk over to the portal, reminded by how and why you came. You wonder if you can go back to Ingnam. You start by picking up a small pebble and throw it through the portal. It passes through the portal. As you walk around the portal, you spot the pebble at the other side. Seems like you can't get back right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.PortalReturn": "You walk over to the portal, reminded by how and why you came. You let out a sigh, knowing you can't return to Ingnam."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsBreasts": "One of them even appears to be arranged like breasts. You blush at the arrangement."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsCentaur": "One of the constellations have the stars arranged to form the shape of a centaur. Interesting."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsDipper": "Ah, the familiar Big Dipper. Wait a minute... you remember that constellation back in Ingnam. You swear the star arrangements are nearly the same."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsError": "Somehow, one of them spells out \"ERROR\". Maybe you should let Kitteh6660 know?"
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsFall": "Ever since the fall of Lethice, the stars are visible."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsIntro": "You pick a location not far from your tent and lay on the ground, looking up at the starry night sky."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsOutro": "You let your mind wander and relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsPhallic": "One of them even appears to be phallic. You blush at the arrangement."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.StarsRelax": "You relax and look at the various constellations."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetAdventureHigh": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures. You chuckle at the moments you were dominating and the moments you were submitting. You suddenly open your eyes from the memory and just relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetAdventureLow": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures and how curiosity got the best of you. You remember some of the greatest places you discovered."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetAdventureMid": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures. Of course, some of them involved fucking and getting fucked by the denizens of Mareth. You suddenly open your eyes from the memory and just relax, wondering why you thought of that in the first place."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetFuture": "You think of what you'd like to do before you went through the portal. You felt a bit sad that you didn't get to achieve your old goals."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetIntro": "You pick a location where the sun is clearly visible from that particular spot and sit down. The sun is just above the horizon, ready to set. It's such a beautiful view."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetNostalgiaHigh": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood. Suddenly, your memories twist into some of the dark and perverted moments. You chuckle at that moment but you shake your head and focus on relaxing."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetNostalgiaLow": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetNostalgiaMid": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood. Suddenly, your memories are somewhat twisted from some of the perverted moments. You shake your head and just relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SunsetOutro": "After the thought, you spend a good while relaxing and watching the sun setting. By now, the sun has already set below the horizon. The sky is glowing orange after the sunset. It looks like you could explore more for a while."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.Swim": "SwimInStream"
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimDeepIntro": "You step into the flowing waters. You shiver at first but you step in deeper. Incredibly, it's rather deep for a stream. "
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimFinish": "Eventually, you swim back to the streambank and dry yourself off before you re-dress yourself in your armor."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimHint": "Take a swim in the stream and relax to pass the time."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimIntro": "You ponder over the nearby stream that's flowing. Deciding you'd like a dip, "
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimMedium": "Your feet are touching the streambed and your head is barely above the water."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimRelax": "You begin to swim around and relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimShort": "Your feet aren't even touching the streambed."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimStrip": "you strip off your armor until you are completely naked. "
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimSwimwear": "you are going to swim while wearing just your swimwear. "
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimTainted": "You feel a bit dirtier after swimming in the tainted waters."
  "Scenes.Camp.Actions.SwimTall": "Your feet are touching the streambed and your head is above water. You bend down a bit so you're at the right height."
