  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCabin": "Build Cabin"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGate.AssistantBuildsGate": " {0} you with building the gate, helping to speed up the process and make construction less fatiguing. "
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGate.CarpentersGuideGate": "You pull out a book titled \"Carpenter's Guide\" and flip pages until you come across instructions on how to build a gate that can be opened and closed. You spend minutes looking at the instructions and memorize the procedures."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGate.FinishBuildingGate": "[pg]You eventually finish building the gate."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGate.ParagraphBreakZero": "[pg]{0}"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGate.TakeWoodSawPlanks": "[pg]You take the wood from supplies, saw the wood and cut them into planks before nailing them together. "
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGatePrompt.CanBuildGate": "You can build a gate to further secure your camp by having it closed at night.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGatePrompt.GateCostNailsStones": "[pg]It will cost 100 nails, 100 stones and 100 wood to build a gate.[pg]"
