  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampGatePrompt.TooExhaustedGate": "You are too exhausted to work on your camp wall!"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.AssistantBuildsWall": " {0} you with building the wall, helping to speed up the process and making the construction less fatiguing."
