  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.AssistantsOneHour": "[pg]Thanks to your assistants, the construction takes only one hour!"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.CarpentersGuideWall": "You pull out a book titled \"Carpenter's Guide\" and flip it's pages until you come across instructions on building a wall. You spend a few minutes looking at the instructions and memorize the procedure."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.DigFourHoles": "[pg]You dig four holes, [if (metric) {fifteen centimeters deep and thirty centimeters|six inches deep and one foot}] wide each, before putting up wood posts, [if (metric) {three and a half meters high and a third of a meter|twelve feet high and one foot}] thick each. You take some wood from your supplies, then saw and cut it into planks before nailing them to the wooden posts."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.FinishWallSegment": "[pg]It's {0} task but you eventually manage to finish building a segment of the wall for your camp!"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.ParagraphBreakZero": "[pg]{0}"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.RememberWallProcedure": "You remember the procedure for building a wall."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWall.WellDoneWallFinished": "[pg]<b>Well done! You have finished the wall! You can build a gate and decorate wall with imp skulls to further deter whoever might try to come and rape you.</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.ContinueBuildingWall": "You can continue work on building the wall that surrounds your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.NotEnoughResources": "[pg]<b>Unfortunately, you do not have sufficient resources.</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.SegmentsComplete": "Segments complete: {0}/5[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.TooExhaustedWall": "You are too exhausted to work on your camp wall!"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.UnrestGrowingPopulation": "A feeling of unrest grows within you as the population of your camp is growing. Maybe it's time you build a wall to secure the perimeter?[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildCampWallPrompt.WallCostNailsStones": "[pg]It will cost 50 nails, 50 stones and 100 wood to work on a segment of the wall.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummy.BitOutOfWay": "[pg]A bit out of the way of everything else, you find a suitable spot where you could let loose without disturbing anyone, and that is where you dig a narrow hole to later ram the post into. Afterwards, you get to work on hammering on the dummy's arms, head, and finally a few more nails for sturdiness. During a short bathroom break, you find a pair of rusty frying pans in the bushes and promptly use them in lieu of hands. Some thick wooden chest plating, a pair of large shoulder guards, and lastly a helmet, and you're done."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummy.LooksLikeScarecrow": "[pg]It looks more like a scarecrow, but historically, there's not much of a difference anyway. You still have some wood and a few nails left over. Does it need anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummy.SawHandTrimWood": "Saw in hand, you quickly trim the wood into the shapes you need: a thick pole for the foundation and main body, shorter ones for the arms, a nice block for the head, and then some boards for the torso and miscellaneous mock-armor."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummyPrompt.DontHaveThat": "Though you don't have that on you right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummyPrompt.NoPlansSimpleDummy": "You don't have any plans prepared, but it shouldn't be too difficult to build a simple training dummy. Some wood, probably a few dozen nails, perhaps a handful of stones, and of course the necessary tools are all you'll need. "
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummyPrompt.NotEnoughResources": "[pg]<b>Unfortunately, you do not have sufficient resources.</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildDummyPrompt.WantToDoNow": "Do you want to do it right now?"
  "Scenes.Camp.BuildMenu.WhatWantToDo": "What do you want to do?"
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.PasteAbsorbed": "Within a few seconds the paste has been totally absorbed and the shrinking stops. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.RathazulAdviceReturns": "[say: Try not to make your balls bigger. If it happens, make sure you have Reducto,] he says. He returns to his alchemy equipment, working on who knows what.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.RathazulRushesAlchemy": "[say: My, my... Look at yourself! Don't worry, I can help, ] he says. He rushes to his alchemy equipment and mixes ingredients. He returns to you with a Reducto.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.RubsPasteAllOver": "He rubs the paste all over your massive balls. It's incredibly effective.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.ScrotumShrinking": "You feel your scrotum shift, shrinking down along with your [balls]. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CallRathazulAndEscapeBadEnd.ShoutForRathazul": "You shout as loud as you can to call Rathazul. Your call is answered as the alchemist walks up to you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampActions": "Camp Actions"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampActions.OddSnowHere": "[pg]There's some odd snow here that you could do something with..."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampActions.PartOfCampShimmers": "[pg]A part of the camp shimmers, the light bending around it. The wizard at the Tower of Deception beckons."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampActions.SnowmanCouldUseSomething": "[pg]You have a [snowman] here that seems like it could use a little something..."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampActions.WhatLikeToDo": "What would you like to do?"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.AcrossFromDaughter": "across from your daughter"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.ArmorWord": "armor"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.BedInsideCabin": "bed inside your cabin."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.BedrollWord": "bedroll"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.BraWord": "bra"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.CabinWord": "cabin"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.HarpyMatronImpatient": "Your harpy matron seems fairly impatient to get to bed with you, the look in her eyes betraying pure lust."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.HerWord": "her"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.HolliInHerTree": "[pg]Holli is in her tree at the edges of your camp. You could go visit her if you want.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.HuntingGatheringTechniques": " about hunting and gathering techniques. Considering their unusual upbringing, it can't be as easy for them...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.JojoSmallBedroll": "There is a small bedroll for Jojo near your "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.JojoStatueEdge": "Jojo stands at the very edge of your camp, as still as a statue. He's so motionless that you're almost worried for a moment, but his head nods in recognition after a moment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.LoinclothWord": "loincloth"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.MouseProbablyHanging": ", though the mouse is probably hanging around the camp's perimeter.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.MouseSleepingOnIt": " and the mouse is sleeping on it right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.NotUsingNightwatch": " but he isn't using it right now, since he is on nightwatch-duty.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.NoteComeSeeMe": ". It reads: [saystart]Come see me at the lake. I've finished your spider-silk "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.NoteOnYourBed": "There is a note on your "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.OwnWord": "own"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.PantiesWord": "panties"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.PluralS": "s"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.RathazulHardAtWork": "The alchemist Rathazul looks to be hard at work with his chemicals, working on who knows what."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.RathazulSignOff": ". -Rathazul[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.RobesWord": "robes"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.RobesWordAgain": "robes"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophieApplyingLipGloss": "Sophie is sitting by herself, applying yet another layer of glittering lip gloss to her full lips.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophieBrushingFeathers": "Sophie is sitting in her nest, idly brushing out her feathers. Occasionally, she looks up from her work to give you a sultry wink and a come-hither gaze.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophieFussingNest": "Sophie is fussing around in her nest, straightening bits of straw and grass, trying to make it more comfortable. After a few minutes, she flops down in the middle and reclines, apparently satisfied for the moment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophieLaysInNest": "Sophie lays in her nest, {0}.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophiePinkReading": "Your pink harpy, Sophie, is currently reading a book. She seems utterly absorbed in it, though you question how she obtained it. Occasionally, though, she'll glance up from the pages to shoot you a lusty look.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophiePlatinumReading": "Your platinum-blonde harpy, Sophie, is currently reading a book--a marked change from her bimbo-era behavior. Occasionally, though, she glances up from the page and gives you a lusty look. Some things never change...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SophieSittingInNest": "Sophie is sitting in her nest, "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SpiderSilkEquipment": " Some kind of spider-silk-based equipment is hanging from a nearby rack. <b>He's finished with the task you gave him!</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.SurroundedByDaughters": "surrounded by your daughters"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.ThemWord": "them"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.TryingToTeach": ", apparently trying to teach "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.TuckedShadedCorner": "Tucked into a shaded corner of the rocks is a bevy of alchemical devices and equipment. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.TuckedShadedCornerAgain": "Tucked into a shaded corner of the rocks is a bevy of alchemical devices and equipment. The alchemist Rathazul looks to be hard at work on the silken equipment you've commissioned him to craft.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampFollowers.ZeroParagraph": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.AmilyBedEmpty": "Amily's bed of grass and herbs lies empty, the mouse-woman still absent from her sojourn to meet your other lover.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.AmilyPacksGearAway": "Amily quietly packs her gear away, giving you a gentle smile when she sees you and asking, [say:Ready for bed, [name]?]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.AmilyStrollingAround": "Amily is currently strolling around your camp, "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ArianTentClosed": "Arian's tent is closed up at its usual location, with its mystical lizan occupant resting inside.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ArianTentHere": "Arian's tent is here, if you'd like to go inside.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ChattingWithAmilyStare": "is sitting down chatting with Amily, but the corrupt mousette is just staring at Isabella's boobs and masturbating. The cow-girl is pretending not to notice."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ChildWord": "child"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ChildrenLivingHere": "You have {0} with her, {1}living here; unlike native Marethians, they will need years and years of care before they can go out into the world on their own."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ChildrenWord": "children"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ContentLookOnFace": " with a content look on her face."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.DippingDartsPoison": "dipping freshly-made darts into a jar of something that looks poisonous"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.DrippingWaterStarkNaked": "dripping water and stark naked from a bath in the stream"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.EatingYourSupplies": "eating some of your supplies"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.FeelingAntsy": " She seems to be feeling antsy."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.FewChildrenExitAnthill": " few of your many children exit the anthill to unload some dirt before vanishing back inside. It makes you feel good knowing your offspring are so productive."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.FlopsDownOnNest": "and she flops down on her nest to have a rest"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HelFussingHammock": "Hel is fussing around her hammock, checking her gear and sharpening her collection of blades. Each time you glance her way, though, the salamander puts a little extra sway in her hips and her tail wags happily.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HelOutOfCamp": "Hel's out of camp at the moment, adventuring on the plains. You're sure she'd be on hand in moments if you needed her, though.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HelReturnedBored": "Hel has returned to camp, though for now she looks a bit bored. Perhaps she is waiting on something.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HelSittingAtEdge": "Hel is currently sitting at the edge of camp, surrounded by her scraps of armor, sword, and a few half-empty bottles of vodka. By the way she's grunting and growling, it looks like she's getting ready to flip her shit and go running off into the plains in her berserker state.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HelVisitingFamily": "Hel's out visiting her family in Tel'Adre right now, though you're sure she's only moments away if you need her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.HeliaPacingAwaiting": "<b>You see the salamander Helia pacing around camp, anxiously awaiting your departure to the harpy roost. Seeing you looking her way, she perks up, obviously ready to get underway.</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaAsleepSnoring": "Isabella is sound asleep in her bunk and quietly snoring."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaBored": "Isabella looks incredibly bored right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaCleaningCamp": "Isabella is busy cleaning up the camp, but when she notices you looking her way, she stretches up and arches her back, pressing eight bullet-hard nipples into the sheer silk top she prefers to wear."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaCookingMeat": "Isabella is cooking a slab of meat over the fire. From the smell that's wafting this way, you think it's beef. Idly, you wonder if she realizes just how much like her chosen food animal she has become."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaCountingGems": "The cow-girl warrioress, Isabella, is sitting down on a chair and counting out gems from a strange pouch. She must have defeated someone or something recently."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaEatingSnack": "Isabella is busy eating some kind of grain-based snack for breakfast. The curly-haired cow-girl gives you a smile when she sees you look her way."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaFringesShield": "Isabella is out near the fringes of your campsite. She has her massive shield in one hand and appears to be keeping a sharp eye out for intruders or demons. When she sees you looking her way, she gives you a wave."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaGatheringGear": "Your favorite chocolate-colored cow-girl, Isabella, is moving about, gathering all of her scattered belongings and replacing them in her personal chest. She yawns more than once, indicating her readiness to hit the hay, but her occasional glance your way lets you know she wouldn't mind some company before bed."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaGrindstone": "Isabella is working a grindstone and sharpening her tools. She even hones the bottom edge of her shield into a razor-sharp cutting edge. The cow-girl is sweating heavily, but it only makes the diaphanous silk of her top cling more alluringly to her weighty chest."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaHiddenBehindRock": "Isabella was hidden behind a rock when you started looking for her, but as soon as you spot her in the darkness, she jumps, a guilty look flashing across her features. She turns around and adjusts her top before looking back your way, her dusky skin even darker from a blush. The cow-girl gives you a smile and walks back to her part of camp. A patch of white decorates the ground where she was standing--is that milk? Whatever it is, it's gone almost as fast as you see it, devoured by the parched, wasteland earth."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaNeedleThread": "Isabella, the red-headed cow-girl, is busy with a needle and thread, fixing up some of her clothes."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaNurseryCorner": " Isabella has set up a small part of her \"corner\" in the camp as a nursery. She has sawn a {0} in half and lined {1} with blankets and pillows to serve as rocking cribs. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaReturnedWhitney": "Isabella has just returned from a late visit to Whitney's farm, bearing a few filled bottles and a small pouch of gems."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaSippingLactaid": "Isabella is sipping from a bottle labeled 'Lactaid' in a shaded corner. When she sees you looking she blushes, though dark spots appear on her top and in her skirt's middle."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaSittingAgainstRock": "Isabella is sitting against one of the large rocks near the outskirts of your camp, staring across the wasteland while idly munching on what you assume to be a leg of lamb. She seems lost in thought, though that doesn't stop her from throwing a wink and a goofy food-filled grin toward you."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaStretchingCarpet": "The dark-skinned cow-girl, Isabella, is sprawled out on a carpet and stretching. She seems surprisingly flexible for someone with hooves and oddly-jointed lower legs."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaTrainingDummies": "The warrior-woman, Isabella is busy constructing dummies of wood and straw, then destroying them with vicious blows from her shield. Most of the time she finishes by decapitating them with the sharp, bottom edge of her weapon. She flashes a smile your way when she sees you."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaWhittling": "Isabella is sitting down with a knife, the blade flashing in the sun as wood shavings fall to the ground. Her hands move with mechanical, practiced rhythm as she carves a few hunks of shapeless old wood into tools or art."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IsabellaWord": "Isabella "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IzmaLazilyReading": "Izma's lazily sitting on the trunk beside her bedroll, reading one of the many books from inside it. She smiles happily when your eyes linger on her, and you know full well she's only half-interested in it."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IzmaLyingOnBack": "Izma is lying on her back near her bedroll. You wonder at first just why she isn't using her bed, but as you look closer you notice all the water pooled beneath her and the few droplets running down her arm, evidence that she's just returned from the stream."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IzmaNotAround": "You notice Izma isn't around right now. She's probably gone off to the nearby stream to get some water. Never mind, she comes around from behind a rock, still dripping wet."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IzmaSettledQuietly": "Near your [if (builtcabin){cabin|bedroll}] lays Izma, settled quietly facing her chest as she sleeps."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.IzmaWaitsOutside": "Izma waits expectantly outside your [cabin]."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaBreastfeeding": "Kiha is breastfeeding her offspring right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaBreastfeedingAgain": "Kiha is breastfeeding her offspring right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaDecimatingDummies": "Kiha is utterly decimating a set of practice dummies she's set up out on the edge of camp. All of them have crudely drawn horns. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaGuardsEdge": "Kiha solemnly guards the edge of your encampment, her fiery eyes glued to the horizon as she grips her axe firmly.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaOutPatrolling": "Kiha's out right now, likely patrolling for demons to exterminate. You're sure a loud call could get her attention.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaPolishingAxe": "Kiha is sitting near the fire, her axe laying across her knees as she polishes it.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaSleepingAxe": "With battle-axe in arm's reach, Kiha is managing to get some shut-eye.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaTellingStories": "Kiha is telling stories to her draconic child{0} right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaTellingStoriesAgain": "Kiha is telling stories to her draconic child{0} right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.KihaTrainingChild": "Kiha is training her {0}. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleAsleep": "Marble is asleep."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleGoneChores": "Marble herself has gone off to Whitney's farm to do some chores right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleGoneMilked": "Marble herself has gone off to Whitney's farm to get milked right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleInNursery": "Marble herself is currently in the nursery, putting your "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleLyingBedroll": "Marble herself is lying on her bedroll right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleNotAtCamp": "Marble herself isn't at the camp right now; she is probably off getting supplies, though she'll be back soon enough."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleNotHere": "Marble isn't here right now; she's still off to see her family."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleNursing": "Marble herself is nursing "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleOutVisitingWhitney": "Marble herself is out right now; she's taken her kids to go visit Whitney. You're sure though that she'll be back within the hour, so you could just wait if you needed her."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarblePlayFight": "Marble herself is involved in a play fight with two of your kids brandishing small sticks. It seems that the <i>mommy monster</i> is terrorising the camp and needs to be stopped by the <i>Mighty Moo and her sidekick Bovine Lass</i>."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarblePracticingHammer": "Marble is off in an open area to the side of your camp right now. She is practicing with her large hammer, going through her daily training."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarblePreparingSleep": "You see Marble preparing to go to sleep with you, stifling a yawn as she gets ready."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleRefereeingWrestling": "Marble herself is currently refereeing a wrestling match between two of your sons. It seems like it's a contest to see which one of them gets to go for a ride between her breasts in a game of <i>Bull Blasters</i>, while the loser has to sit on her shoulders."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleTellingStory": "Marble herself is in the camp right now, telling a story about her travels around the world to her kids as they gather around her. The children are completely enthralled by her words. You can't help but smile."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleTendingKids": "Marble is currently tending to your kids, but she looks a bit stressed out right now. It looks like {0} might just be too many for her to handle on her own..."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleWaitingBedroll": "Marble is hanging around her bedroll waiting for you to come to bed. However, sometimes she lies down for a bit, and sometimes she paces next to it."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleWanderingAround": "Marble herself is wandering around the camp right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MarbleWatchingKid": "Marble herself is watching your kid"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.MostOnFire": "Most of them are on fire.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.NearBaseYourOwn": "near the base of your own"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.NeatlyLaidWord": "Neatly laid "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.NextToYourCabin": "next to your cabin"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.OneChildExitAnthill": " one of your children exit the anthill to unload some dirt before continuing back down into the colony. It makes you feel good knowing your offspring are so productive."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.OneCowGirlChild": "one of your cow-girl children"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PaleLizanWaves": "The pale lizan waves to you from nearby, giving you a questioning glance and nodding towards your [cabin]."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ParagraphBreakAgain": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ParagraphBreakFourth": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ParagraphBreakThird": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PeelingImpSkullFlesh": "peeling the last strips of flesh off of an imp's skull and putting it on a particularly flat, sun-lit rock to bleach as a trophy"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PeriodBreak": ".[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PhyllaAnthillDistance": "You see Phylla's anthill in the distance. Every now and then you see"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PhyllaAppearsAnthill": " Phylla appear out of the anthill to unload some dirt. She looks over to your campsite and gives you an excited wave before heading back into the colony. It makes you feel good to know she's so close."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PlayingAroundCamp": " playing around the camp right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.PluralS": "s"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.RathazulNosebleed": ". Rathazul glances over and immediately gets a nosebleed"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SalamanderLeaningRock": "Your salamander lover is leaning against a rock, clearly about to nod off. It seems she doesn't want to wait much longer to join you in your [bed]."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SavedForChild": "Some of them are saved for her child{0} to train on. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SecondBedrollHammer": "A second bedroll rests next to yours; a large two handed hammer sometimes rests against it, depending on whether or not its owner needs it at the time. "
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SittingWithIzma": "is sitting down with Izma and recounting some stories, somewhat nervously. Izma keeps flashing her teeth in a predatory smile."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SittingWithJojo": "is sitting down with Jojo, smiling knowingly as the mouse struggles to keep his eyes on her face."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SittingWithRathazul": "is sitting down with Rathazul, chatting amiably about the weather."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SlouchingInShade": "slouching in the shade of some particularly prominent rocks, whittling twigs to create darts for her blowpipe"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SomeChildrenExitAnthill": " some of your children exit the anthill using main or one of the additionally entrances to unload some dirt. Some of them instead of unloading dirt coming out to fulfill some other task that their mother gave them. You feel a little nostalgic seeing how this former small colony grown to such a magnificent size."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.SureShedBeBack": " You're sure she'd be back in moments if you needed her."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.TalkingWithAmily": "is talking with Amily, sharing stories of the fights she's been in and the enemies she's faced down. Amily seems interested but unimpressed."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.TeachingAxes": "Right now, she's teaching her child{0} how to make use of axes.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.TeachingVariousTechniques": "Right now, she's teaching various techniques.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ThumbingThroughBook": "is sitting down and thumbing through a book."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ToBedWord": " to bed."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.WornBedrollBelonging": " is a worn bedroll belonging to Izma, your tigershark lover. It's a snug fit for her toned body, though it has some noticeable cuts and tears in the fabric. Close to her bed is her old trunk, almost as if she wants to have it at arms length if anyone tries to rob her in her sleep.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.YourCowGirlChild": "your cow-girl child"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ZeroParagraph": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampLoversMenu.ZeroParagraphAgain": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampPetsMenu.AkkyNearby": "You can see [akky] nearby."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampPetsMenu.AkkyNotFound": "[Akky] isn't around, but after a quick search you find him {0}."
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.BathgirlAsleepCleavage": "[bathgirlname] has fallen asleep, using her {0}cleavage as a pillow.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.FaintMoanNearby": "Sometimes you hear a faint moan from not too far away. No doubt the result of your slutty toy mouse playing with herself.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.HearMovementFindTracks": "From time to time you can hear movement from around your camp, and you routinely find thick puddles of mouse semen. You are sure Jojo is here if you ever need to sate yourself.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.LatexyLurksRocks": "[latexyname] lurks in a secluded section of rocks, only venturing out when called for or when she needs to gather water from the stream.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.MilkGirlHopefulEyes": "Your well-endowed, dark-skinned milk-girl is here. She flicks hopeful eyes towards you whenever she thinks she has your attention.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.SummonCeraph": "While she is, of course, nowhere to be seen, you could summon Ceraph.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.CampSlavesMenu.ZeroParagraph": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.ChooseFurColorSaveUpdate.NowHaveFurReturned": "You now have {0} fur. You will be returned to your camp now and you can continue your usual gameplay."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.AmilyRelocatedBedding": "Amily has relocated her grass bedding to the opposite side of the camp from the strange tree; every now and then, she gives it a suspicious glance, as if deciding whether to move even further.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.AndTentAreBoth": "and tent are both "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CabinNearEdge": "Your cabin is situated near the edge of camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CampSilentCompanionsSleeping": "Your camp is silent as your companions are sleeping right now.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CampsiteComfortableIsabella": "Your campsite got a lot more comfortable once Isabella moved in. Carpets cover up much of the barren ground, simple awnings tied to the rocks provide shade, and hand-made wooden furniture provides comfortable places to sit and sleep. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CampsiteLivedIn": "Your campsite is starting to get a very 'lived-in' look. The fire-pit is well defined with some rocks you've arranged around it, and your bedroll and tent have been set up in the area most sheltered by rocks. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CampsiteSimpleTent": "Your campsite is fairly simple at the moment. Your tent and bedroll are set in front of the rocks that lead to the portal. You have a small fire pit as well. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CaneAppearsOnBed": "Out of nowhere, a cane appears on your {0}. It looks like it once belonged to the Erlking. Perhaps the cane has been introduced into the game, and you've already taken revenge on the Erlking? Regardless, you pick it up. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CarvedArtworkRocks": "You've even managed to carve some artwork into the rocks around the camp's perimeter.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CloseToItEntrance": " Really close to it there is a small entrance to the underground maze created by your ant children. And due to Phylla wish from time to time one of your children coming out this entrance to check on the situation near portal. You feel a little more safe now knowing that it will be harder for anyone to go near the portal without been noticed or... if someone came out of the portal."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CloudsSkyGlowingOrange": "Even with the clouds, the sky near the horizon is glowing bright orange. The sun may have already set at this point. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CrudeSnowman": "A somewhat crude snowman stands in the camp, constructed by Nieve and your child{0} in a bout of play.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.CurrentlyOneSkull": "There is currently one skull. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkCloudsRain": "It is dark out. The sky is covered by clouds raining water upon the ground.{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkCloudsRainFlashes": "It is dark out. The sky is covered by clouds raining water upon the ground and occasionally the sky flashes with lightning.{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkCloudsRedSpot": "It is dark out. The sky is covered by clouds and you could faintly make out the red spot in the clouds which is presumed to be the moon.{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkNoStars": "It is dark out, made worse by the lack of stars in the sky. A blood-red moon hangs in the sky, seeming to watch you, but providing little light.{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkStarsDot": "It is dark out. Stars dot the night sky. A blood-red moon hangs in the sky, seeming to watch you, but providing little light.{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DarkWeatherInvalid": "It is dark out. [b:The weather seems strangely invalid.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DebilitatedArousedMasturbate": "<b>You are debilitatingly aroused, and can think of doing nothing other than masturbating.</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DebilitatinglyArousedHardReach": "<b>You are debilitatingly aroused, but your sex organs are so difficult to reach that masturbation isn't at the forefront of your mind.</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.DebilitatinglyArousedNumbed": "<b>You are debilitatingly aroused, but your sexual organs are so numbed the only way to get off would be to find something tight to fuck or get fucked...</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.EmberCrusadeSkullsPile": "Since Ember began {0} 'crusade' against the minotaur population, skulls have begun to pile up on either side of the entrance to {1} den. There're quite a lot of them.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.FewImpSkulls": "Few imp skulls have been mounted near the gateway"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.FutureChildrenWord": "future children"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.GateConstructed": "A gate has been constructed in the middle of the walls; it gets closed at night to keep any invaders out. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.GettingThinnerWeaker": "<b>You are getting thinner and you're losing muscles. </b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.GrowingPileOfStones": "There's a growing pile of stones built up at the fringes of your camp. It's big enough to be considered a small hill by this point, dotted with a couple small harpy nests just barely big enough for two."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.HermaphroditeUnlocked": "[pg]<b>Congratulations! You have unlocked hermaphrodite option on character creation, accessible from New Game Plus!</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.IsWord": "is "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.LightOutsideGoodTime": "It's light outside, a good time to explore and forage for supplies with which to fortify your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ManyImpSkulls": "Many imp skulls decorate the gateway and wall, some even impaled on wooden spikes"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.MarbleSecureNursery": "Marble has built a fairly secure nursery amongst the rocks to house your "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.MoreTimePasses": "More time passes...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.MustEatSomething": "<b>You have to eat something; your stomach is growling {0}. </b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.NearlyFinishedCabin": "There's a nearly-finished cabin. It looks complete from the outside but inside, it's missing flooring.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.NewHomeComfy": "Your new home is as comfy as a camp site can be. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.OuterEdgesHealthyTree": "On the outer edges, half-hidden behind a rock, is a large, very healthy tree. It grew fairly fast, but seems to be fully developed now. Holli, Marae's corrupt spawn, lives within.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ParagraphBreakAgain": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ParagraphBreakFourth": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ParagraphBreakThird": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.PeriodBreak": ".[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.PortalShimmers": "The portal shimmers in the background as it always does, looking menacing and reminding you of why you came."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.RookeryImmense": "An immense harpy rookery dominates the edge of your camp, towering over the rest of it. Innumerable harpies flit around it, always working on it, assisted from below by the few sisters unlucky enough to be flightless."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.RookeryMassive": "A massive harpy rookery towers over the edges of your camp. It's almost entirely built out of stones that are fit seamlessly into each other, with many ledges and overhangs for nests. There's a constant hum of activity over there day or night."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.RookeryPrettyBig": "The harpy rookery at the edge of camp has gotten pretty big. It's taller than most of the standing stones that surround the portal, and there's more nests than harpies at this point. Every now and then you see the four of them managing a boulder they dragged in from somewhere to add to it."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.RookeryQuiteLarge": "The rookery has gotten quite large. It stands nearly two stories tall at this point, dotted with nests and hollowed out places in the center. It's surrounded by the many feathers the assembled harpies leave behind."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.RookeryTowering": "A towering harpy rookery has risen up at the fringes of your camp, filled with all of your harpy brood. It's at least three stories tall at this point, and it has actually begun to resemble a secure structure. These harpies are always rebuilding and adding onto it."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SaveNotFlagFixed": "This save doesn't seem to have gone through the flag shifting fix. If this is a save from Revamp, just click \"Revamp\". If this is an OtherCoCAnon save, then please click \"Fix me\" to do all the flag wizardry required to keep things stable."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SetUpPerfectly": "set up perfectly, and in good repair. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SeveralImpSkulls": "Several imp skulls have been mounted near the gateway"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SingleImpSkull": "A single imp skull has been mounted near the gateway"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SkyBlackBinary": "[b:The sky is black and flashing green 0s and 1s, seems like the weather is broken!] "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SkyDarkHeavyClouds": "The sky is dark as it's thick with dark gray clouds that rain and occasionally the sky flashes with lightning. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SkyFairlyDarkRain": "The sky is fairly dark as it's covered by the clouds that rain water upon the lands. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SkyGlowOrange": "Though you cannot see the sun, the sky near the horizon began to glow orange. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SkyLightGrayClouds": "The sky is light gray as it's covered by the clouds. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SmallishHarpyNest": "There's a smallish harpy nest that your daughter has built up with rocks piled high near the fringes of your camp. It's kind of pathetic, but she seems proud of her accomplishment."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SunAlreadySet": "The sun has already set below the horizon. The sky glows orange. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SunCloseToHorizon": "The sun is close to the horizon, getting ready to set. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SunShinesBlueSky": "The sun shines brightly, illuminating the now-blue sky. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.SunShinesOccasionalClouds": "The sun shines brightly, illuminating the now-blue sky. Occasional clouds dot the sky, appearing to form different shapes. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.TheFirePit": "The fire-pit "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ThereAreCurrently": "There are currently {0}. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ThornyTreeSprouted": "A thorny tree has sprouted near the center of the camp, growing a protective canopy of spiky vines around the portal and your camp. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.TidyNestGrasses": "A surprisingly tidy nest of soft grasses and sweet-smelling herbs has been built close to your {0}. A much-patched blanket draped neatly over the top is further proof that Amily sleeps here. She changes the bedding every few days, to ensure it stays as nice as possible.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.ToServeAsDeterrence": " to serve as deterrence. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.TrapsSurroundingHome": "You have a number of traps surrounding your makeshift home, but they are fairly simple and may not do much to deter a demon. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.TwoWeeksInTent": "You realize that you have spent two weeks sleeping in a tent every night. You wonder if there's a way you can sleep nicely and comfortably. Perhaps a cabin will suffice?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.UnfinishedCabin": "There's an unfinished cabin. It's currently missing windows and door.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.UnfinishedWoodenStructure": "There's an unfinished wooden structure. As of right now, it's just frames nailed together.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.WeakerStarvation": "<b>You are getting weaker due to starvation. </b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.WoodenWallSmall": "A thick wooden wall has been erected to provide a small amount of defense. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.WoodenWallsHalfPerimeter": "Thick wooden walls have been erected; they surround one half of your camp perimeter and provide good defense, leaving the other half open for access to the stream. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoCamp.WoodenWallsSomeDefense": "Thick wooden walls have been erected to provide some defense. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.AmilySnuggleUp": "Planning to sleep for {0}, Amily and you closely snuggle up against one another. As she contently rests her head on top of your [chest], you feel her mousy tail wrapping around [if (isbiped) {{your leg|you}}].[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.CarefullyLieDownBears": "You carefully lie down so as not to crush the mass of bears covering your bed. You're filled with a sense of warmth and innocence from their presence as you drift off to sleep for {0}.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.CurlUpEmber": "You curl up next to Ember, planning to sleep for {0}. Ember drapes one of {1} wings over you, keeping you warm.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.CurlUpPlanningSleep": "You curl up, planning to sleep for {0}.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.CurlUpSophie": "You curl up next to Sophie, planning to sleep for {0}. She wraps her feathery arms around you and nestles her chin into your shoulder. Her heavy breasts cushion flat against your back as she gives you a rather chaste peck on the cheek and drifts off towards dreamland..."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.EnterCabinTurnIn": "You enter your cabin to turn yourself in for the night. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.KihaJoinsYou": "While you prepare to sleep for {0}, Kiha eagerly joins you in your [cabin]. She rests her head upon your chest, and you wrap an arm tightly around her. A smile spreads across her face as you hold her close her close. She whispers, [say: I love you, Doofus.]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.LayDownSophieSnuggles": "As you lay down to sleep for {0}, you find the harpy-girl, Sophie, snuggling herself under her blankets with you. She slips in between your arms and guides your hands to her enormous breasts, her backside already snug against your loins. She whispers, [say: Something to think about for next morning... Sweet dreams.] as she settles in for the night."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.LieDownResumeSleeping": "You lie down to resume sleeping for the remaining {0}.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.SophieAlreadyInBed": "While you're getting ready for bed, you see that Sophie has already beaten you there. She's sprawled out on her back with her arms outstretched, making little beckoning motions towards the valley of her cleavage. You snuggle in against her, her pillowy breasts supporting your head and her familiar heartbeat drumming you to sleep for {0}."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.SophieClimbsUnderSheets": "Sophie climbs under the sheets with you when you go to sleep, planning on resting for {0}. She sleeps next to you, just barely touching you. You rub her shoulder affectionately before the two of you nod off."
  "Scenes.Camp.DoSleep.ZeroParagraph": "{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.ContinueWaitAnotherHour": "You continue to wait for another hour.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.ContinueWaitMoreHours": "You continue to wait for {0} more hours.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.DesireFindBeeGirl": "The desire to find the bee girl that gave you this cursed [cock] and have her spread honey all over it grows with each passing minute.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.FluidStarvedGoo": "You feel the fluid-starved goo rubbing all over your groin as if Valeria wants you to feed her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.WaitingVeryTroubled": "Your time spent waiting is very troubled, and you aren't able to settle down. You get up feeling tired and unsatisfied, always thinking of Marble's milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DoWait.YouWait": "You wait {0}...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.AddDick": "A piece of the main pole you sawed off seems fitting enough, this will do."
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.AddDickAfter": "[pg]You manage to carve a fitting mock-phallus out of it and smooth it down enough to remove any potential splinters. After a few nails, it sits fast and proud on the dummy's crotch. Anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.AddTits": "You only have some planks for this. Oh well, conical tits it is."
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.AddTitsAfter": "[pg]A few minutes later, your dummy now has a rather prodigious, though perhaps somewhat impractical and sharply angular, chest. Anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.DoItNow": "Do you want to do it right now?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.Finish": "That's all you need. You quickly carve a crude face into its head, then bury the stake deep enough into the ground to not wobble, secure it with a few stones, and step back to admire your work. It's nothing to brag about in particular, but all in all a sturdy, hopefully long-lasting piece of training equipment. Serviceable."
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.LackResources": "Though you don't have that on you right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.LooksLikeScarecrow": "[pg]It looks more like a scarecrow, but historically, there's not much of a difference anyway. You still have some wood and a few nails left over. Does it need anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.NamePrompt": "[pg]Now then, you should give it a name. Everything needs a name. What will it be?"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.NoResources": "[pg]<b>Unfortunately, you do not have sufficient resources.</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.Prompt": "You don't have any plans prepared, but it shouldn't be too difficult to build a simple training dummy. Some wood, probably a few dozen nails, perhaps a handful of stones, and of course the necessary tools are all you'll need. "
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.SawInHand": "Saw in hand, you quickly trim the wood into the shapes you need: a thick pole for the foundation and main body, shorter ones for the arms, a nice block for the head, and then some boards for the torso and miscellaneous mock-armor."
  "Scenes.Camp.DummyBuild.WorksOnDummy": "[pg]A bit out of the way of everything else, you find a suitable spot where you could let loose without disturbing anyone, and that is where you dig a narrow hole to later ram the post into. Afterwards, you get to work on hammering on the dummy's arms, head, and finally a few more nails for sturdiness. During a short bathroom break, you find a pair of rusty frying pans in the bushes and promptly use them in lieu of hands. Some thick wooden chest plating, a pair of large shoulder guards, and lastly a helmet, and you're done."
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.CarveCrudeFace": "That's all you need. You quickly carve a crude face into its head, then bury the stake deep enough into the ground to not wobble, secure it with a few stones, and step back to admire your work. It's nothing to brag about in particular, but all in all a sturdy, hopefully long-lasting piece of training equipment. Serviceable."
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.CarveMockPhallus": "[pg]You manage to carve a fitting mock-phallus out of it and smooth it down enough to remove any potential splinters. After a few nails, it sits fast and proud on the dummy's crotch. Anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.DummyProdigious": "[pg]A few minutes later, your dummy now has a rather prodigious, though perhaps somewhat impractical and sharply angular, chest. Anything else?"
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.GiveItAName": "[pg]Now then, you should give it a name. Everything needs a name. What will it be?"
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.OnlyPlanksConicalTits": "You only have some planks for this. Oh well, conical tits it is."
  "Scenes.Camp.EngenderDummy.PieceOfMainPole": "A piece of the main pole you sawed off seems fitting enough, this will do."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.AdaptedForAir": "Or at least it might be, were you not equally adapted for the air as for the water. Instead it's as simple as unfurling your [wings] and rising into the sky like one of the dragons of old, diving into the barrel from above with little more than a splash[if (kida) { and a surprised squeal from Kid A}] left in your wake."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.AroundIfNeeded": "around if {0} needed you."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.BlinkBreathingSlows": "[pg]You blink [if (isday) {into the light|away the darkness}] as your breathing slows enough for the world to refocus, and you're met with the concerned face of your anemone child peeking [if (kidaxp < 40) {shyly|in bewilderment}] over the edge of her home. [if (kidaxp < 40) {All it takes is a|There's no need to even}] nod before she's crawling out of the barrel with an ease you can only envy, and though it might feel a little silly to be wrapped in the cool embrace of your daughter's arms as she helps you off the ground, you're thankful for her help."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.BreathQuickensMuscles": "Soon your breath quickens, your muscles burn and ache, and no matter how much your will stands strong, the barrel seems as insurmountable a foe as ever. With a shaky sigh, you're forced to release your grip, crumpling to the ground in a graceless heap."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.CantStayForever": "[pg]Still, you can't stay forever, no matter how much you'd like to. Life on the surface continues on whether you're ready or not, the demons won't stop themselves, and [if (!kida && str <= 20) {somebody has to clean up this mess you've made|there's always more to do}]. With a disappointed sigh, you suck in a dry breath[if (kida) {, tell your daughter your goodbyes,}] and heave yourself over the side of the barrel[if (!kida && str <= 20) {, thankful for your ramp to bump and slide your way down|[if (str > 50) { and lower yourself to the ground|[if (kida) { with your daughter's help|, flopping to the ground in an awkward lump}]}]}]. It almost makes you want to climb back in again, but no, you must brace yourself for this life on land and [if (!kida && str <= 20) {set about pushing your storage chest back to your [cabin]|go about the rest of your [day]}]."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.ConsiderableStrength": ". With your considerable strength, it's almost effortless to pull yourself up and over, swinging your tail out wide as you slide in with a splash."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.DecidedThenStrip": "[pg]So that's decided, then.[if (!isnaked) { Not wanting to get your [armor] wet, you strip down until you're clad in nothing but your [if (hasscales) {eye-catching array of scales|[if (simpleskin) {[skinfurscales]|[skinfurscales] and [underbody.skinfurscales]}]}].}] The final difficulty remains getting yourself inside, a problem only exacerbated by the limitations of your [merfolk] tail outside of the sea. "
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.DiveBeneathRim": "you dive beneath the barrel's rim, luxuriating in the [if (isday) {comforting|refreshing}] coolness that surrounds you. It's like you were meant to be here, a private sea all your own, the world outside little more than a distortion beyond the surface. You could soak for hours and let the stress melt out of your limbs, minutes passing by like ripples as you [if (height < 60) {swim|float}] with effortless ease."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.DumpsYouOverRim": "[pg]Which is right when she dumps you unceremoniously over the rim with a splash before climbing back in herself."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.FirstCaressOfWater": "[pg]The first caress of the water within washes away your exertion as steadily as the tide, filling your lungs with new purpose as "
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.KeepEyeOnThings": "able to keep an eye on things."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.KidASettlesBeside": "Kid A settles in beside you, evidently unsure of why you've climbed inside this time, but wrapping your arm around your daughter seems to serve as answer enough. It's rather[if (height > 84) { cramped, but still}] cozy when she nestles into your embrace, and [if (isday) {the bustle of daily life fades to the gentle lap of the water|the night rests quiet and peaceful}] as the two of you bond in your own amphibious way, your tail winding lazy loops around her legs as you pull her close enough [if (height < 60) {to rest your head upon her shoulder|[if (height < 72) {lean into each other|for her to rest her head upon your shoulder}]}]. It's effortless to remain beside her for as long as you'd like, drinking in her affection as readily as the cool water all around and letting [if (height < 60) {her dote on you like you were [if (ischild) {her|a}] child|[if (height < 72) {the world pass by in silence|your fingers tangle in her gooey hair}]}], the two of you content to watch the [sun]light shimmer off your [underbody.skinfurscales] with every shift of your tail."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.KidAWavesGoodbye": "[pg]Kid A waves at you when you give the barrel one last parting glance."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.LittleOccupiedIzma": "Sure, it's a little occupied at the moment, but [if (height < 60) {you think the two of you could easily manage to squish in.|isn't it a parent's privilege to cuddle up embarrassingly close to [his] daughter?}] Besides, the little anemone probably knows better than anyone else how good it feels to submerge when someone's built like you."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.ManageToHeft": "Maybe you could manage to heft yourself over, and with that thought you press your palm into the rim of the barrel and press up with all your might"
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.MaybeIzmaClose": "[pg]Well, maybe Izma is close.[if (latexy) { Or [latexyname].}] But Kid A has to be up there, and you're sure she'll understand."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.NoOneElseUsing": "It's not like anyone else is using it right now, after all, and it seems [if (height > 84) {like it might be a tight squeeze, but you'll manage|to be sized just about right [if (height < 60) {to be your own personal swimming pool|for you}].}]"
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.NotBeDeterred": " You're not about to be deterred that easily, though, and after a quick break to recover, you set about building yourself the crudest of ramps with whatever odds and ends you can find nearby: loose stones, your camp's chest, [if (builtchair) {that chair from your cabin|some logs from your storage}]. It's not much to look at by the time it's done, and sure it probably drained you more than even the water will restore, but it's more about making a point. If nothing else, dragging yourself up those jagged rocks and rough wood lets you bask in the sting of victory when you finally manage to crawl inside."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.RememberTheBarrel": "[pg]That's when you remember the barrel tucked away in the corner of your camp, full of so much delicious water you can almost shiver at the thought. "
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.ShuffleAlongCamp": "As you shuffle along through your camp, the [if (isday) {heat of the sun and }]lack of any moisture in the air leave[if (!isday) {s}] you looking for any chance to get out of the elements for a bit. Of course, your [cabin] isn't much better, and even though simply imagining the stream has you feeling a bit refreshed, it's far enough away that you wouldn't be "
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.ThrashingTailMomentum": ", thrashing your tail for any momentum that might help you swing yourself high enough to slip inside. "
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.UmHelp": "[pg][say:Um... help?]"
  "Scenes.Camp.EnjoyANiceBarrel.WorkingSurprisingly": "And it's working, surprisingly enough, even as the wood rubs rough against your fingertips and your teeth grit and grind under the strain, your body giving all that it has until [if (kida) {a curious Kid A peeks out of the barrel at you, needing [if (kidaxp < 40) {a moment of recognition|no time at all}] to reach down and help you inside|your tail scrapes across the rim and you can let the rest of you follow along behind}]."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnterCabin": "Enter Cabin"
  "Scenes.Camp.EnterVoid.StareAtSkyAbyss": "You stare at the sky, the abyss that covers the entirety of Mareth."
  "Scenes.Camp.EnterVoid.WarpedAcrossTime": "[pg]You are warped across time and space once again."
  "Scenes.Camp.Entry": "You are at your campsite. It is [timeofday] on day [daycount]."
  "Scenes.Camp.ExaminePortal.WalkOverPortalAgain": "You walk over to the portal, reminded by how and why you came. You let out a sigh, knowing you can't return to Ingnam."
  "Scenes.Camp.ExaminePortal.WalkOverToPortal": "You walk over to the portal, reminded by how and why you came. You wonder if you can go back to Ingnam. You start by picking up a small pebble and throw it through the portal. It passes through the portal. As you walk around the portal, you spot the pebble at the other side. Seems like you can't get back right now."
  "Scenes.Camp.ExgartuanCampUpdate.BlackMilkDribbles": "<b>Black milk dribbles from your [nipple]. It immediately dissipates into the air, leaving you feeling alone. It looks like you became too small for Exgartuan!"
  "Scenes.Camp.ExgartuanCampUpdate.DemonDidntStay": " It looks like the demon didn't want to stick around without your manhood.</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.ExgartuanCampUpdate.ParagraphBreakCloseBold": "[pg]</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.ExgartuanCampUpdate.TooSmallForExgartuan": " Perhaps you got too small for Exgartuan to handle?</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.ExgartuanCampUpdate.UrgeToUrinate": "<b>You suddenly feel the urge to urinate, and stop over by some bushes. It takes wayyyy longer than normal, and once you've finished, you realize you're alone with yourself for the first time in a long time."
  "Scenes.Camp.Explore": "Explore"
