  "Scenes.Camp.FixSave.BimboMiniskirtFixed": "Bimbo Miniskirt Toggle being fixed[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.FixSave.EveryBugFound": "Every time a bug is found, OtherCoCAnon loses a minute of his life. He has about 5 years left."
