  "Scenes.Camp.SkyRape.ApprehensiveSkyComplies": "[pg]Apprehensive though it may be, the Marethian sky complies, licking your {0}. The instant its tongue makes contact, you shudder. A feeling of euphoria passes over you, and you're gleeful to receive the treatment you deserve around here. {1}You grind your hips forward, pressing yourself against the sky for more. It hesitates, ever unsure of this exchange, but gives into your demands."
