  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.AmilyStreambankBikini": "[pg]Amily is standing at the streambank, looking a bit embarrassed in her revealing bikini. She shouldn't be, though{0}. She eventually manages to muster up the confidence to walk over and join you in the stream."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.BeginToSwimRelax": "[pg]You begin to swim around and relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.EmberBathGlimpse": "[pg]You chance on a brief view of Ember taking a bath some ways away. Her {0} body is on full display for a few moments before she catches you peeking and shoots off with a blush."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.FeetNotTouchingBed": "Your feet aren't even touching the streambed."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.FeetTouchingAboveWater": "Your feet are touching the streambed and your head is above water. You bend down a bit so you're at the right height."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.FeetTouchingBedBarely": "Your feet are touching the streambed and your head is barely above the water."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.FrightenedFinApproach": "[pg]You are momentarily frightened when you see a fin protruding from the water, approaching you with deadly speed! However, just as it draws within striking distance, the familiar figure of Izma breaks the surface with a splash. [say: I was just about to enjoy my daily swim, my Alpha,] she says, giving you a sharp smile."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.HeliaJoinsStream": "[pg]Helia, your salamander lover, saunters over to join you in the stream, shouting [say: Hey, lover mine!] just a bit too loudly as she arrives. When she lowers her toned, scaly body in, the water appears to heat up until it begins to steam like a sauna."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.MarbleStripsNaked": "[pg]Your cow-girl companion Marble strips herself naked, apparently unashamed to do so in the middle of your camp, and joins you for a swim. [say: Sweetie, you enjoy swimming, don't you?] she asks."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.PonderNearbyStream": "You ponder over the nearby stream that's flowing. Deciding you'd like a dip, "
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.RathazulShallowSection": "[pg]You spot Rathazul walking into the shallow section of the stream, most likely taking a bath to get rid of the [if (silly) {persistent smell of cheese that always follows him|the smell of his latest alchemical experimentation}]."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.StepIntoFlowingWaters": "You step into the flowing waters. You shiver at first but you step in deeper. Incredibly, it's rather deep for a stream. "
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.StripOffCompletelyNaked": "you strip off your [armor] until you are completely naked. "
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStream.SwimInSwimwear": "you are going to swim while wearing just your swimwear. "
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStreamFinish.BeforeYouRedress": " before you re-dress yourself in your [armor]"
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStreamFinish.DirtierAfterSwimming": "You feel a bit dirtier after swimming in the tainted waters.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStreamFinish.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwimInStreamFinish.SwimBackToBank": "Eventually, you swim back to the streambank and dry yourself off"
  "Scenes.Camp.SwitchMagic.ErrorInvalidMagic": "[pg]Error: Invalid magic type"
  "Scenes.Camp.SwitchMagic.LowerBodyAndSpirit": "[pg]You lower yourself onto the ground, quietly concentrating on the powers of body and spirit. A pressure exudes throughout the surrounding earth, your eyes glimmer with emerald green."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwitchMagic.MeditateEmotionalBalance": "[pg]You meditate over your arcane knowledge, tapping into the philosophy of emotional balance vs mental clarity."
  "Scenes.Camp.SwitchMagic.SpellsBlackAndWhite": "[pg]<b>Your spells have changed to Black & White.</b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.SwitchMagic.SpellsTerrestrialFire": "[pg]<b>Your spells have changed to Terrestrial Fire.</b>"
