  "Scenes.Camp.WaitBee": "The desire to find the bee girl that gave you this cursed cock and have her spread honey all over it grows with each passing minute.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WaitGoo": "You feel the fluid-starved goo rubbing all over your groin as if Valeria wants you to feed her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WaitHint": "Wait for four hours.[pg]Shift-click to wait until the night comes."
  "Scenes.Camp.WaitText": "You wait {0}...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WaitWithdrawal": "Your time spent waiting is very troubled, and you aren't able to settle down. You get up feeling tired and unsatisfied, always thinking of Marble's milk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.CantBeAllDream": "No, it can't be. It's all just a dream! You've got to wake up!"
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.GetUpStillConfused": "[pg]You get up, still feeling confused from the nightmares."
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.GetUpStillTraumatized": "[pg]You get up, still feeling traumatized from the nightmares."
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.MarbleAsksYoureFine": "[pg][say: Are you okay, sweetie?] Marble asks. You assure her that you're fine; you've just had a nightmare."
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.MumbleAnotherBadEnd": "[pg]You mumble to yourself [say: Another goddamn bad-end.]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.RealizeNeedToShrink": "[pg]You realize the consequences of having oversized balls and you NEED to shrink it right away. Reducto will do."
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeFromBadEnd.WakeScreamMirror": "[pg]You wake up and scream. You pull out a mirror and take a look at yourself. Yep, you look normal again. That was the craziest dream you ever had."
  "Scenes.Camp.WakeUp": "You sleep for {0} and wake up. It is [timeofday] on day [daycount]."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.BigDipperFamiliar": "[pg]Ah, the familiar Big Dipper. Wait a minute... you remember that constellation back in Ingnam. You swear the star arrangements are nearly the same."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.ConstellationBreasts": "[pg]One of them even appears to be arranged like breasts. You blush at the arrangement."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.ConstellationCentaur": "[pg]One of the constellations have the stars arranged to form the shape of a centaur. Interesting."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.ConstellationError": "[pg]Somehow, one of them spells out \"ERROR\". Maybe you should let Kitteh6660 know?"
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.ConstellationPhallic": "[pg]One of them even appears to be phallic. You blush at the arrangement."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.MindWanderRelax": "[pg]You let your mind wander and relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.PickLocationNotFar": "You pick a location not far from your {0} and lay on the ground, looking up at the starry night sky."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.RelaxLookConstellations": "[pg]You relax and look at the various constellations."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchStars.StarsVisibleSinceLethice": "[pg]Ever since the fall of Lethice, the stars are visible."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.AccomplishWord": "accomplish"
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.AfterThoughtWatchingSunset": "[pg]After the thought, you spend a good while relaxing and watching the sun setting. By now, the sun has already set below the horizon. The sky is glowing orange after the sunset. It looks like you could explore more for a while."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.BeforeThroughPortal": " before you went through the portal. You felt a bit sad that you didn't get to achieve your old goals."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.DoWord": "do"
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.NostalgiaWashestChildhood": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.NostalgiaWashestFriends": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood. Suddenly, your memories are somewhat twisted from some of the perverted moments. You shake your head and just relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.NostalgiaWashestLovers": "A wave of nostalgia washes over you as you remember your greatest moments from your childhood. Suddenly, your memories twist into some of the dark and perverted moments. You chuckle at that moment but you shake your head and focus on relaxing."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.PickLocationSunVisible": "You pick a location where the sun is clearly visible from that particular spot and sit down. The sun is just above the horizon, ready to set. It's such a beautiful view.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.ReflectCuriosityAdventures": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures and how curiosity got the best of you. You remember some of the greatest places you discovered."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.ReflectDominatingAdventures": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures. You chuckle at the moments you were dominating and the moments you were submitting. You suddenly open your eyes from the memory and just relax."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.ReflectFuckingAdventures": "You reflect back on your greatest adventures. Of course, some of them involved fucking and getting fucked by the denizens of Mareth. You suddenly open your eyes from the memory and just relax, wondering why you thought of that in the first place."
  "Scenes.Camp.WatchSunset.ThinkWhatYoud": "You think of what you'd like to "
  // 原版 scenes/Camp.hx:3579 promptSaveUpdate() 与 :3727 furColorSelection1/2
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Caution1": "<b><u>CAUTION</u></b>"
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Caution2": "\nIt appears that you are importing your save from vanilla CoC."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Caution3": "[pg]If you're planning to save over your original save file, please stop to think. If you overwrite the save file from original game, it will no longer be backwards compatible with the original CoC."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Caution4": "[pg]I suggest you create separate save files. I recommend you use slots 10-14 for saving your progress in this mod."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Caution5": "[pg]Without further ado, enjoy everything CoC Revamp Mod has to offer!"
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.AchievementsIntro": "Starting in version 0.8 of this mod, achievements are now awarded. To ensure that you don't have to go through scenes again on new savefile, achievements will be awarded depending on flags."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.AchievementsSome": "[pg]Some achievements, however, will require you to do it again."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.AchievementsSaved": "[pg]Achievements are saved in a special savefile so no matter what savefile you're on, any earned achievements will be added to that special savefile."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.KeltBow": "Due to a bug where your bow skill got reset after you've slain Kelt, your bow skill got reset. Fortunately, this is now fixed. As a compensation, your bow skill is now instantly set to max!"
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.Reclassified": "Due to a bit of restructuring regarding equipment, any reclassified equipment (eggshell shield and fur loincloth) that was equipped are now unequipped."
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.FurColorIntro": "Starting in version 1.3 of the mod, fur color is now separate from hair color. So as a one-time offer, you can now choose fur color!"
  "Scenes.Camp.PromptSaveUpdate.LethiceAgain": "Due to the official release of Lethice, you can now fight her again! Be prepared to face the Drider Incubus and Minotaur King beforehand!"
  "Scenes.Camp.FurColor.Chosen": "You now have {0} fur. You will be returned to your camp now and you can continue your usual gameplay."
  "Scenes.Camp.FurColor.Brown": "Brown"
  "Scenes.Camp.FurColor.Chocolate": "Chocolate"
